HyperCode Evolution Research 🚀
Mate, HyperCode is already pointed in the right direction: a neurodivergent-friendly cognitive architecture with agent orchestration, memory, Docker services, autonomous evolution, healing, and a visual dashboard. The next leap should be controlled agent engineering, not simply adding more autonomous agents.

Your project files describe Agent X as a meta-agent that creates and deploys specialised agents, alongside a Core API, Crew Orchestrator, DevOps evolution agent, Healer Agent, dashboard, Redis, PostgreSQL, and observability services.

