Add Replay Early
Live SSE is not enough. Browsers refresh, Wi-Fi drops, and long agent jobs happen.

Persist events with an increasing sequence number:

sql
CREATE TABLE agent_run_events (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    run_id UUID NOT NULL,
    sequence BIGINT NOT NULL,
    event_type TEXT NOT NULL,
    payload JSONB NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),
    UNIQUE (run_id, sequence)
);
Then provide:

text
GET /api/agui/runs/{run_id}/events?after=42
The frontend reconnects with its most recent sequence number, replays missed messages, and then opens a live stream again.

